▶ 5. Consulta direta a cada shard: cada conta só existe no nó da sua região
  pg-europa:
  $ psql "host=pg-europa.global.local,pg-europa-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('81533c04-2f04-44a7-90de-f484458359a0','0e43368a-7797-421e-8780-67b590722461')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-EU-00000006 | EUR      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  pg-america:
  $ psql "host=pg-america.global.local,pg-america-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('81533c04-2f04-44a7-90de-f484458359a0','0e43368a-7797-421e-8780-67b590722461')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-AM-00000071 | USD      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  ✔ GS-EU-00000006 só no pg-europa, GS-AM-00000071 só no pg-america
  a réplica também a tem (replicação streaming):
  $ psql "host=pg-europa-replica.global.local dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, pg_is_in_recovery() AS replica FROM accounts WHERE iban = 'GS-EU-00000006'"
          iban      | replica 
    ----------------+---------
     GS-EU-00000006 | t
    (1 row)
    

